1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000


2
00:00:34,440 --> 00:00:36,000
The Western envoy is dead

3
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:37,880
The Truth-telling Gu is gone

4
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:39,760
The Dragon Jade remains missing to this day

5
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:41,840
Do you all have a death wish?

6
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:45,080
My dear Chen, I didn't mean to

7
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:47,960
What about Li Zhi'an then?

8
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,480
Where is Li Zhi'an?

9
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:52,120
Chen... my dear Chen

10
00:00:54,160 --> 00:00:55,240
Li Zhi'an

11
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:01,760
Your Highness the Third Prince, what are you doing?

12
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:02,760
Damn you!

13
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:04,320
Speak!

14
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:06,000
Where is the Dragon Jade?

15
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,000
You're drunk

16
00:01:10,400 --> 00:01:10,920
What's wrong?

17
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:13,760
Guards! Escort the Third Prince back to rest immediately

18
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:24,480
Still won't reveal the Dragon Jade's whereabouts?

19
00:01:24,480 --> 00:01:26,680
Are you trying to ruin all my efforts?

20
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:28,880
Your Highness mustn't do this!

21
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:37,960
I'm not some weakling to be trampled upon

22
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:40,240
You keep professing your love for me

23
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:42,920
Now you'd raise your hand against me over the Dragon Jade

24
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:45,320
If my lord has no affection left for me

25
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:46,680
You may simply divorce me

26
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:52,480
If you think you can take advantage of my blindness

27
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:54,200
I'm quite skilled at locating by sound

28
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:57,000
Today we fight to the death

29
00:01:57,760 --> 00:02:00,400
Or I, Li Zhi'an, am unworthy of my military lineage

30
00:02:02,880 --> 00:02:05,920
You damned blind woman! How dare you strike me!

31
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:20,240
Zhu Huaijin!

32
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,240
Have you fallen for her?

33
00:02:22,880 --> 00:02:24,080
Your Highness is drunk

34
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:28,440
If this matter reaches His Majesty and the ministers

35
00:02:29,280 --> 00:02:30,480
It would be most inappropriate

36
00:02:32,320 --> 00:02:33,120
Guards!

37
00:02:34,520 --> 00:02:35,840
Escort His Highness back

38
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:44,840
My dear Chen

39
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,480
Thank you for your assistance, Seventh Brother

40
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:00,760
I won't let this matter rest

41
00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:04,440
Please summon my Li family to discuss the divorce

42
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,680
Are you alright?

43
00:03:11,360 --> 00:03:13,080
This cold compress medicine works wonders

44
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:15,000
I'll have someone bring it to you later

45
00:03:16,200 --> 00:03:18,120
It's alright, Hua Mei

46
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,440
Help me back

47
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:21,240
Yes

48
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:33,120
How dare you touch my woman

49
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:34,720
Zhu Huaichen

50
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,680
You must have a death wish

51
00:04:04,320 --> 00:04:05,120
Assassin!

52
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:14,320
Catch the assassin!

53
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:26,520
Assassin! Get the assassin!

54
00:04:29,760 --> 00:04:30,560
Chen Lang

55
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,160
Search separately

56
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:51,480
We must catch that assassin

57
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,360
Understood

58
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,480
That assassin's movements just now...

59
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:57,160
That was clearly Zhu Huaijin

60
00:04:58,320 --> 00:04:59,960
He went to assassinate Zhu Huaichen

61
00:05:07,520 --> 00:05:10,600
Your Highness, last night the Third Prince...

62
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:13,760
Zhu Huaichen is dead

63
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,560
No, that's not...

64
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:18,240
Last night an assassin cut off the Third Prince's hand

65
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,840
Is he standing up for me?

66
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,160
Useless

67
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,560
A bunch of good-for-nothings

68
00:05:28,080 --> 00:05:30,240
We must find that assassin

69
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:32,760
And make him suffer a thousand cuts

70
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:35,680
Dear Chen, don't be angry

71
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:37,640
I've found the most skilled craftsman in the world

72
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:39,600
to forge these iron hooks with silver claws for you

73
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,160
They say wearing these will make you no different from ordinary people

74
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:45,000
and even allow you to harm others without detection

75
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:47,240
Perhaps this misfortune will prove to be a blessing in disguise

76
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:50,840
Do you take me for a child?

77
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:55,640
So easily fooled?

78
00:05:55,640 --> 00:05:56,800
Every time something happens, you beat around the bush

79
00:05:57,520 --> 00:06:01,080
trying to distract me

80
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:02,360
This time you even dared to lie to me

81
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:04,720
Could it be

82
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,400
that you're in league with that assassin?

83
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:09,560
Chen, that's so unfair!

84
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:14,160
I've served you with all my heart and soul

85
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:16,160
with utmost dedication

86
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:17,960
How could you think of me like that

87
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:27,320
Don't forget

88
00:06:27,880 --> 00:06:29,560
who your real master is

89
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:30,920
Your Highness, please calm your anger

90
00:06:31,280 --> 00:06:33,000
Chiyu will investigate the truth immediately

91
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:35,120
Get out

92
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,400
Yes

93
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:00,520
I understand now

94
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:32,560
I won't let you get hurt again

95
00:09:03,680 --> 00:09:04,640
Zhu Huaijin

96
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:07,000
Why did you blow out the candle

97
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:09,920
Does he also know about the fire caused by this candlestick in the previous life

98
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:12,200
being knocked over

99
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,680
Could it be that he has also been reborn
